reply:
I'll build a 10-card Spanish vocabulary deck with flip cards and a reviewed-count progress bar that starts at 0 of 10.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/d-t6.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 2,
          "gap": "1.5rem",
          "align": "top",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "vocab-heading",
                  "component": "heading",
                  "text": "Spanish Vocabulary Review"
                },
                {
                  "id": "vocab-intro",
                  "component": "body",
                  "text": "Flip each card to check its meaning. Track how many of the 10 words you have reviewed."
                },
                {
                  "id": "review-progress",
                  "component": "progress_bar",
                  "value": 0,
                  "label": "Cards reviewed",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "show_percent": "true",
                  "caption": "0 of 10 cards reviewed"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "vocab-deck",
                  "component": "flashcard_deck",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "label_front": "SPANISH",
                  "label_back": "ENGLISH",
                  "cards": [
                    { "front": "casa", "back": "house" },
                    { "front": "perro", "back": "dog" },
                    { "front": "agua", "back": "water" },
                    { "front": "libro", "back": "book" },
                    { "front": "comer", "back": "to eat" },
                    { "front": "feliz", "back": "happy" },
                    { "front": "amigo", "back": "friend" },
                    { "front": "escuela", "back": "school" },
                    { "front": "ciudad", "back": "city" },
                    { "front": "tiempo", "back": "time / weather" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The deck flips each card to show its English meaning. The progress bar is set to 0 of 10. The catalog doesn't let the deck report flips back to the progress bar, so the count has to be updated by the agent by resending the `progress_bar` value and caption as the user reviews cards.
